    "/apiOmnichannel/webhookEvents": {
      "patch": {
        "summary": "Retrieve a list of webhook events (API Omnichannel - webhook_events table) with filtering, searching, and pagination.",
        "description": "This endpoint retrieves a filtered list of webhook event records across active and archived integration channels. It is designed to support system operators, AI modules, or compliance personnel monitoring event delivery history, retry attempts, and evidence of successful or failed deliveries. Supports advanced searching by channel, event type, status, attempt count, or delivery window. Results are paginated for efficiency and can be sorted by delivery state or recency. Enables business and forensic review of all webhook actions within omnichannel commerce, with full compliance to data retention and audit regulations.",
