      "post": {
        "summary": "Create a new webhook event (API Omnichannel - webhook_events) for system or partner notification delivery.",
        "description": "This operation creates a new webhook event entry, initiating the process of delivering an event notification to an external target or partner channel via the omnichannel integrations module. The request body specifies the required integration channel, event type, destination URL, and other metadata necessary for delivery and compliance auditing. The operation logs initial status (pending), supports event evidence preservation via hash/tracing, and triggers downstream delivery mechanisms. This endpoint is suitable for automated systems, partner integrations, and monitoring/diagnostic flows. All delivery activity is tracked by attempt count, delivery status, and compliance metadata.",
