        "description": "This operation updates properties of a specific webhook event, as identified by its ID. Typical fields to update include delivery status (success, failed), attempt count, delivered_at timestamp, and error/cause notes for failed deliveries. The update is designed for event monitoring, delivery diagnostics, and compliance evidence flows (e.g., including/annotating external audit details). All update actions are tracked with evidence and maintain compliance with event/audit logging requirements. Access controls ensure only appropriately authorized system or service actors can make updates to event state, protecting integrity of business/compliance records.",
