/**
 * Test retrieving a specific security event log by a valid ID and ensure all event metadata and context are correctly returned.
 * Attempts retrieval with an invalid ID and expects a not found error. Also checks for presence of evidence chain fields as required by event type.
 *
 * 1. Create a new security event record.
