 * 1. Create a new order status (orderStatus.post).
 * 2. Fetch the specific status by ID (orderStatus.getById).
 * 3. Try unknown/invalid ID for 404 (orderStatus.getById).
 * 4. Delete the created order status (orderStatus.eraseById).
 * 5. Try to fetch deleted status for 404 (orderStatus.getById).
 */
